WEBVTT

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.661
Even now that I know the
truth about Soichiro...

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.990
I find myself thinking about
Kyoko even more than ever.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.549
Even so, I can't seem to
change our relationship.

00:02:02.009 --> 00:02:05.049
Day after day,
I only pass the time.

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:16.491
I-I'm s-so sorry!

00:02:16.691 --> 00:02:18.270
No, i-it's all
my f-fault!

00:02:26.371 --> 00:02:27.572
- - Here.
- - Thanks.

00:02:30.371 --> 00:02:31.508
Come back soon.

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:35.611
S-See you later!

00:03:26.088 --> 00:03:29.960
Godai, any man can do it!
Say how you feel!

00:03:30.758 --> 00:03:31.871
Kyoko!

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.651
I love...

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:40.350
I just can't say it!

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:41.641
Godai!

00:03:47.111 --> 00:03:49.008
It's so tragic!
So sad!

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:53.850
Drink up.
Drink it.

00:03:54.121 --> 00:03:54.850
Thanks.

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:03.799
But you can't live like this.
Gather your courage and say it!

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:05.161
But...

00:04:05.799 --> 00:04:09.111
No buts! It's what
women wait for!

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:16.180
But I just can't...

00:04:17.141 --> 00:04:20.829
I feel for you, buddy!
But if you don't say it...

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:23.790
you can't call
yourself a man!

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:26.440
Kyoko...

00:04:28.822 --> 00:04:30.838
I-It's no good!
I just can't!

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:34.120
Godai! Say it! Spill it!
Let it all out!

00:04:34.829 --> 00:04:35.940
Kyoko...

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.112
Okay! I'll say
it for you!

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:45.499
Kyoko, I love...

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:49.190
No!
Don't you dare!

00:04:55.509 --> 00:04:59.490
There's a
moon out tonight!

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:03.250
There's a
moon out tonight!

00:05:03.519 --> 00:05:05.690
Hey, Soichiro.
Here's a present...

00:05:12.201 --> 00:05:16.540
Tenants of Maison Ikkoku:
I have returned!

00:05:29.209 --> 00:05:32.141
Akemi, you can't sleep here.
You'll catch cold.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:35.970
Lemme alone.
I'm sleepy.

00:05:37.891 --> 00:05:39.970
Come on.
Please wake up.

00:05:54.572 --> 00:05:56.850
Gee, Manager, you're
stronger than I thought.

00:05:59.911 --> 00:06:02.720
Mrs. Ichinose, don't just
stand there. Lend me a hand.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.180
She's pretty heavy.

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:07.588
Sorry about that.

00:06:09.588 --> 00:06:11.201
She's soused.

00:06:11.588 --> 00:06:15.072
The customer was buyin'!
I polished off a whole bottle!

00:06:15.588 --> 00:06:17.170
Poor customer.

00:06:19.259 --> 00:06:22.362
Who the heck put a
trash can in my way!?

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:26.180
- - Who can that be?
- -Some drunk passing by.

00:06:26.612 --> 00:06:29.240
You're gonna say it!
You're gonna say it, right?

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:31.990
Yeah! I'll say it in front
of God and everybody!

00:06:32.281 --> 00:06:32.920
Godai!

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:40.579
Good, Godai!
Do what you must!

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:51.269
ATTENTlON PEOPLE
OF THE CITY!

00:06:51.959 --> 00:06:54.588
l, YUSAKU GODAl...

00:06:55.298 --> 00:06:59.310
AM IN LOVE
WITH KYOKO!

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.862
He said it!

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:09.509
G-Godai!

00:07:13.322 --> 00:07:16.661
KYOKO!
I LOVE YOU!

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.641
Are you all
right, Godai!?

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:32.040
KYOKO, I LOVE YOU!

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:34.338
Please stop!
The neighbors...

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:36.072
Don't stop him!

00:07:36.338 --> 00:07:39.709
He can only say it
with liquid courage!

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.548
A sad excuse
for a man!

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:44.310
No, I'm not saying
it 'cause I'm drunk!

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:45.759
Here's my proof!

00:07:46.019 --> 00:07:48.040
I'M STONE COLD SOBER!

00:07:49.019 --> 00:07:50.310
Will you behave yourself!?

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:57.329
Aren't you Kyoko?

00:07:57.701 --> 00:07:58.401
I am!

00:07:59.031 --> 00:08:01.519
Did'ja hear
what I just said?

00:08:02.031 --> 00:08:03.401
Along with the
rest of the city.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:05.970
Really?
You heard me?

00:08:06.709 --> 00:08:10.548
This is great!
I almost gave up on you!

00:08:13.709 --> 00:08:14.970
Let's go to your room.

00:08:15.709 --> 00:08:17.201
We're going to my room?

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:19.209
That's right.
Let's go.

00:08:41.072 --> 00:08:42.879
I'll be your guide!

00:08:52.421 --> 00:08:53.589
Soichiro!

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:56.620
Allow him this
one shot! Soichiro!

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:06.240
Let me down!
Hey!

00:09:06.429 --> 00:09:08.298
- - I'm home!
- - What're you doin'?

00:09:08.429 --> 00:09:10.100
Mrs. Ichinose, please help me!

00:09:11.769 --> 00:09:14.839
Hey, manager lady!
Don't stop 'em!

00:09:15.769 --> 00:09:17.142
I'm just a tenant.

00:09:17.441 --> 00:09:19.990
I can't believe the
kid finally scored!

00:09:21.111 --> 00:09:23.039
Akemi, please stop him!

00:09:25.451 --> 00:09:26.379
Godai, go for it!

00:09:26.789 --> 00:09:27.460
Akemi!

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:43.642
- - What fun we're having.
- - Good evenin'!

00:09:44.142 --> 00:09:44.960
Be careful!

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:48.629
Now I see.
It's all clear.

00:09:49.809 --> 00:09:52.152
Manager and Godai
sitting in a tree...

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:52.970
No!

00:09:53.142 --> 00:09:54.870
Stop this, Godai.

00:09:55.152 --> 00:09:56.701
Mr. Yotsuya, help me!

00:09:59.152 --> 00:10:00.019
Mr. Yotsuya...

00:10:06.490 --> 00:10:07.539
Bon appetit.

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:08.850
You traitor!

00:10:28.179 --> 00:10:29.230
Soichiro...

00:10:53.539 --> 00:10:54.410
So close.

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:44.330
Kyoko...

00:12:07.070 --> 00:12:08.060
Spacing.

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:09.940
Headache.

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:14.700
I got a bump.
Where'd that happen?

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:17.460
Maybe you hit a phone pole.

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:19.450
Yeah, maybe.

00:12:47.110 --> 00:12:48.010
Mornin'!

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:50.570
Oh, Godai.

00:12:51.110 --> 00:12:53.600
A shame about last night.

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:57.520
Godai. The manager was furious.

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:03.870
Naturally. Stopping in the
middle would anger any woman.

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:07.710
W-What do you mean?
Did I do something wrong?

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:12.040
Mr. Yotsuya!
Please tell me!

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:16.450
Godai. Some things are
better left unknown.

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:19.040
You naughty boy.

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:21.330
''Left unknown ''?
Mr. Yotsuya!

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:22.710
Godai.

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:24.860
Sakamoto...

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.700
I was drunk off my butt.
Don't remember a thing.

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:40.700
What did I do
to the manager!?

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:01.450
You don't remember
anything about last night?

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:05.910
Lower the volume!
Did I do something wrong?

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:09.330
So you really don't remember.

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:11.290
Listen close.

00:14:13.190 --> 00:14:14.740
First your slacks and shirt...

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:21.240
Godai...

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:24.400
I danced around naked!?

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:28.910
Kyoko, look at me!
Look at me!

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:31.320
Eeeek! A man!

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.790
Look at me!
Look at me!

00:14:34.210 --> 00:14:36.360
Eeeek! A man!

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:52.500
l, uh...
Manager...

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:26.240
Kill me now!

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:29.660
- - But it's kind of funny...
- - What is?

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:39.140
Like Mr. Yotsuya said. She
was mad 'cause you stopped...

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:43.060
Right! I stopped dancing
'round naked, so she got mad...

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:49.770
Don't stop! Please,
don't stop, Godai!

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:52.480
Something's not right here.

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:54.290
Now that you mention it...

00:15:56.950 --> 00:15:57.620
Hey, hey!

00:15:57.630 --> 00:15:58.240
What, what?

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:00.910
It's him! The guy
from Maison Ikkoku.

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:02.940
Last night he
was shouting...

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:04.980
- - Yeah!
- - And then...

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:08.480
- - And what he said!
- - Ohmigod! I can't believe it!

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:13.700
I must have done
something awful.

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:17.250
You must have shown
off something very private.

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:21.120
Nothing else would cause
their twisted smiles!

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:22.530
You're right!

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:26.440
The kids these days
are just shameless!

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.020
That's it
I'm doomed...

00:16:45.010 --> 00:16:46.530
Don't get so depressed.

00:16:47.350 --> 00:16:49.540
We aren't sure that's
what happened, yet.

00:16:50.350 --> 00:16:51.280
Yeah, but...

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:03.690
Yo, Godai. So you were hugging
a trash can and crying?

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:06.040
I saw the
whole scene!

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:09.950
I thought my clothes stunk like
garbage. And it's all your fault!

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:14.970
Right! Get the real
story from Akemi.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:18.660
Besides that? Like
hugging and kissing Soichiro?

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:20.520
That explains
my dog hairs.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:22.530
But that's just
the warm up.

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:25.240
The best part started when
you and the manager...

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:32.870
Godai? The story was
just getting interesting.

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:35.690
No!

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:38.200
I don't wanna hear!
I don't wanna hear!

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:03.110
I danced around naked...

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:08.480
then I kissed the
trash can and Soichiro.

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:16.120
And I chased Kyoko around
while shouting obscenities.

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:19.760
And...
And...

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:27.870
...then, in front of
everybody, I grabbed her!

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:48.180
- - See you!
- - G'bye!

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:32.820
KYOKO, I LOVE YOU!

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:44.510
I don't know.
Did he mean it?

00:19:45.190 --> 00:19:47.870
But it's too
serious to joke about.

00:19:48.860 --> 00:19:50.640
It kept me up all night.

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:10.190
If Godai hadn't fallen
asleep, I'd have...

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:22.780
I don't know why I did that.
A woman should know better.

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:25.460
Women should know better.

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:29.910
D-Damn!
I HAVE to say something!

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:33.540
l...
About last night...

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:37.200
You must think
I'm a complete jerk.

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:39.650
I was just
a bit surprised.

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:42.610
I suppose I can't just
blame it on the booze.

00:21:43.980 --> 00:21:44.680
l...

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:50.510
I'd rather somebody did that
when they were serious and sober.

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:53.780
Do you think l
could do that sober!?

00:21:54.310 --> 00:21:58.530
But since you were drunk, I don't
know if you were serious or not!

00:21:59.320 --> 00:22:02.460
I couldn't do that seriously!
I'm not that type of man!

00:22:02.990 --> 00:22:05.240
Then it was a joke!?

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:09.970
You said you loved me as
a joke!? That's too much!

00:22:24.350 --> 00:22:26.070
B-But...

00:22:28.020 --> 00:22:30.210
Does that mean I wasn't
dancing around naked...?

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:33.730
I'm such an idiot!

00:22:39.360 --> 00:22:40.890
Soichiro, I'm sorry.

00:22:41.030 --> 00:22:42.970
I swear I'll never look
at another man again!

00:22:58.390 --> 00:22:59.530
Kyoko!

00:23:03.720 --> 00:23:06.400
Kyoko!
Kyoko!

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:15.780
Drunk again!?

00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:52.140
I've decided to take
tennis lessons!

00:23:52.770 --> 00:23:56.040
It's because everybody's
telling me that I'm gloomy.

00:23:57.100 --> 00:24:00.350
Next: ''The Mysterious Tennis Coach
is the Rival of Love. ''

00:24:01.110 --> 00:24:03.730
It's incredible. Coach Mitaka
doesn't have a single filling...

00:24:04.110 --> 00:24:06.260
But when he smiles
his teeth sparkle.
